General
- Title/version: OpenAI API v2.3.0
- Docs: https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference
- TOS: https://openai.com/policies/terms-of-use
- Contact: https://help.openai.com/ (OpenAI Support)
- License: MIT (https://github.com/openai/openai-openapi/blob/master/LICENSE)
- Server: https://api.openai.com/v1
- Security: API key (ApiKeyAuth)

Endpoint: GET /chat/completions (operationId: listChatCompletions)
- Tag: Chat
- Summary: List Chat Completions
- Query parameters (all optional):
  - model (string): Filter by model used.
  - metadata (object|null): Up to 16 string key/value pairs (keys ≤64 chars, values ≤512 chars). Used to filter completions. Query format: metadata[key]=value (e.g., metadata[key1]=value1&metadata[key2]=value2).
  - after (string): ID of last chat completion from previous page (pagination cursor).
  - limit (integer): Number of completions to retrieve. Default 20.
  - order (string): asc|desc sort by timestamp. Default asc.

Response 200: ChatCompletionList
- object (string): "list"
- data (array): Chat completion objects

Chat completion object (core fields)
- id (string): Unique identifier.
- created (integer): Unix timestamp (seconds).
- model (string): Model used.
- service_tier (string|null): Processing tier.
  - Values: auto (default), default, flex, scale, priority
  - Behavior:
    - auto: Uses project’s configured tier (default unless otherwise configured).
    - default: Standard pricing/performance.
    - flex/priority/scale: Uses respective tier if selected.
    - Response echoes the tier actually used, which may differ from request.
- system_fingerprint (string, deprecated): Backend configuration fingerprint.
- choices (array): One or more choice objects (multiple if n>1).

Choice object (required: finish_reason, index, message, logprobs)
- index (integer): Choice index.
- finish_reason (string): Why generation stopped.
  - stop: natural stop/stop sequence
  - length: max tokens reached
  - content_filter: content omitted by filters
  - tool_calls: model called a tool
  - function_call: model called a function (legacy)
- message: Assistant message generated.
  - Required: role, content, refusal
  - role (string): assistant (constant)
  - content (string|null): Message text.
  - refusal (string|null): Refusal text if applicable.
  - tool_calls (array): Tool calls generated (discriminated by type).
    - Function tool call (type=function)
      - id (string)
      - function: { name (string), arguments (string JSON; may be invalid/hallucinated, validate before use) }
      - Required: id, type, function
    - Custom tool call (type=custom)
      - id (string)
      - custom: { name (string), input (string) }
      - Required: id, type, custom
  - annotations (array): URL citation annotations (used e.g., with web search).
    - Item (type=url_citation):
      - url_citation object (required fields): start_index (int), end_index (int), url (string), title (string)
