- prompt (string | string[] | int[] | int[][], nullable, default '' for string): Prompts as text or tokens. Note: <|endoftext|> is the training document separator; if omitted, model generates from a new document start.
- best_of (int, nullable, default 1, range 0–20): Generates best_of completions server-side and returns the best (highest average logprob). Not compatible with streaming. With n, best_of controls total candidates; must be > n. Can rapidly consume tokens; tune max_tokens/stop.
- echo (boolean, default false): Echo back the prompt with the completion.
- frequency_penalty (number, nullable, default 0, range -2 to 2): Penalizes tokens by frequency to reduce repetition.
