- n (int, nullable, default 1, range 1–128): Number of completions to generate per prompt. Beware token usage.
- presence_penalty (number, nullable, default 0, range -2 to 2): Penalizes tokens based on presence to encourage new topics.
- seed (int64, nullable): Attempts deterministic sampling for same seed+params. Determinism not guaranteed; monitor with system_fingerprint in response.
