  - Standard atmosphere: 1 atm = 101325 Pa https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/cuu/Value?stdatm
- Engineering Toolbox (engineering property data):
  - Air density vs. temperature/pressure https://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/air-density-specific-weight-d_600.html
  - Specific gas constant for dry air (R = 287.058 J/kg·K) https://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/air-specific-heat-capacity-d_705.html
  - Speed of sound in air vs. temperature https://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/speed-sound-d_82.html
- NASA Glenn Research Center:
  - Speed of sound in air (formula and discussion) https://www.grc.nasa.gov/www/k-12/airplane/sound.html

