5) Ralph’s Coffee – Madison Ave (Upper East Side)
- Why: Iconic branded cafe with polished ambiance; suitable for a relaxed catch‑up if you’re on the east side of the park.
- Address: 888 Madison Ave (btw E 71st–72nd St), New York, NY 10021
