What to expect over the next month
- FIPE updates monthly; your exact FIPE Code lets you re-check December’s table easily.
- FIPE is a reference table (not negotiated transaction price), so dealer year-end promotions may not fully appear in FIPE immediately.
- Practical tip: Lock your shortlist now and recheck the same FIPE codes in early December to see if reference values adjusted. If you plan to finance/insure, banks/insurers typically key off FIPE; even small FIPE moves can affect LTV and premiums.

