Primary sources used
- React official docs: https://react.dev (Context7 ID: /reactjs/react.dev)
- Vue 3 official docs: https://vuejs.org (Context7 ID: /vuejs/docs)
- Pinia (officially recommended store for Vue): https://pinia.vuejs.org (Context7 ID: /vuejs/pinia)

Documentation coverage and trust signals (from Context7 index)
